{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Join Plunko, a determined green ball with a sharp left hook, on an action-packed journey through the Roundlands.</strong> Under the peaceful reign of Lord Orb, life is carefree\u2014friendly boxing matches keep the Roundlandians entertained. But when King Trungle from the Polygon Valley threatens this harmony, it\u2019s up to Plunko to defend his homeland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305770/extras/description1.gif?t=1741374994\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Master parkour challenges and fast-paced boxing battles</strong> to become the &quot;Champion of the Roundlands.&quot; Along the way, supercharge your abilities with Roundlandian energy drinks, letting you blast through levels at breakneck speeds. Strategically use energized walls to maintain momentum, but be mindful of the clock! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305770/extras/description3.gif?t=1741374994\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With vibrant 2D pixel art, <strong>Plunko</strong> combines the charm of classic platformers with high-speed, skill-based gameplay. Navigate colorful worlds, confront tough enemies, and discover secrets to aid in your quest to stop King Trungle and protect the Roundlands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305770/extras/description2.gif?t=1741374994\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A determined hero with a strong left hook and an unstoppable spirit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Online or LAN PvP boxing matches in the peaceful Roundlands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenging parkour and thrilling combat encounters.</p></li><li><p 